+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: exact GF(2) elimination on all local cover signatures is an "
+        "O(n*d^2+d^3) algorithm; at the shipping preset its measured full-graph "
+        "cost is recorded by selftest in G5 and G6, whereas rank saturation on "
+        "the certified d+2 vertex prefix gives the same nullspace in fewer than "
+        "300 packed exact operations once the XOR invariant is recognized."
