The bare oracle run is in progress at the 96-vertex rung. If any model returns a valid affine matrix, the harness will escalate automatically; I’ll use its actual held rung, rather than preselecting a larger input.
diff --git a/gen_2511_01556.py b/gen_2511_01556.py
