Bare hardening is complete: 96 vertices was solved, while all three vendors failed at 192 vertices, so `medium` is the shipping rung. I’m now locking that preset, rerunning every local gate there, and then running the structural-hint and placebo arms in isolated directories so the bare transcript cannot be overwritten.
