+| Preset | Seed | Model | Result | Reason |
+|---|---:|---|---|---|
+| easy | 959106853 | Gemini 3.1 Pro | failed | unequal affine fibres |
+| easy | 658322077 | Claude Sonnet 5 | failed | response exhausted its 32k completion budget |
+| easy | 470634688 | Grok 4.6 | **solved** | verified `ok`; escalated |
+| medium | 1939403664 | Gemini 3.1 Pro | failed | unequal affine fibres |
+| medium | 1184184876 | GPT-5.6 Terra | failed | unequal affine fibres |
