codex
The 384-vertex selftest correctly stopped on G6: the simple spectral decoder sometimes sees extra \(-1\) eigenvectors and its `nullity == 3` assumption is too brittle. I won’t suppress that. I’m measuring the failure pattern now; either I strengthen the reference decoder to handle the extra eigenspace exactly, or this family cannot ship at the G9-escalated rung.
