codex
The third bare 384-vertex oracle—Grok—eventually produced a valid certificate, so that rung is not shippable. The prescribed bare harness has automatically escalated to 768 vertices with the same 34-atom answer; this is an oracle-driven Step 4 escalation, not a manual retune. I’m letting that run finish, and any eventual shipping level must still pass the structural-hint gate.
