codex
Implemented and verified a native Track B generator grounded in Lemma 2.1, Theorem 2.2, and Theorem 1.2’s proof in the [full paper](https://arxiv.org/html/2511.01556v1).

- Shipping preset: `hard` — 768 vertices, 1,152 edges.
- All G1–G9 gates pass.
- Bare, structural-hint, and placebo arms: each 0/3 solved.
- Reference algorithm: 121,489,118 exact field operations across eight instances.
- Compact route: at most 213 operations.
- Answer: 95 characters, 34 atoms.
- Emit smoke test produced two distinct verified instances.

Deliverables:

- [gen_2511_01556.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2511.01556/gen_2511_01556.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2511.01556/selftest_report.json)
- [README.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2511.01556/README.md)
- [llm_loop_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2511.01556/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2511.01556/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2511.01556/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)
